<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=665" title="View the profile of Naithein">Naithein</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 137<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/44-knightman.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Rawr ?<br />
								<br />
								
								<a href="http://members.msn.com/laldayen@hotmail.com" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/msntalk.gif" alt="laldayen@hotmail.com" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://edit.yahoo.com/config/send_webmesg?.target=naithein%40yahoo.com"><img src="http://opi.yahoo.com/online?u=naithein%40yahoo.com&amp;m=g&amp;t=0" alt="naithein@yahoo.com" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="aim:goim?screenname=PadisharrCreel&amp;message=Hi.+Are+you+there?"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/aim.gif" alt="PadisharrCreel" border="0" /></a><br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=665"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.xanga.com/lamdeir" title="" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:laldayen@hotmail.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1273.msg12642#msg12642"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1273.msg12642#msg12642">Sibling Punishment. . .?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> November 14, 2004, 10:10:14 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Okay, So I just recently had an incident were my youngest brother, six, jumped on my sister because she took his spot on the recliner, I asked him if he asked her to move first and he lied at first but then replied with an inocent &quot;I forgot&quot;. For that I refused to give him his bed time drink and afterwards he went into a rampage and slammed a chair onto the floor, I sent him to his room for the rest of the night.<br /><br />Was I being to harsh? I somewhat think I was but somewhat think I wasn&#039;t.<br />When I was younger my mom would simple put a wooden stick to my ass and tell me to go to my room, but since I don&#039;t have the authority to do that. . .<br /><br />Anyway, any advice on if i was being to harsh or other punishments would be appreciated...if you can mkae any sense from this post.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />[56 Paladin] Naithein (High Elf) - Rodcet Nife <br />[54 Druid] Naithien (Wood Elf) - Rodcet Nife<br />[43 Monk] Spankii (Human) - Rodcet Nife
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg12647"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
