							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Now to ask the more important questions. How old are you and were you left in charge of your siblings, also why?<br /><br />Correct me if I am wrong, but it seems to me that you do not feel comfortable punishing your siblings. 
