	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg12676"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=765" title="View the profile of Moraganna">Moraganna</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Female.gif" alt="Female" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 81<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/ceres.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Kiss muh cute ass~<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=765"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1273.msg12676#msg12676"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1273.msg12676#msg12676">Re: Sibling Punishment. . .?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #8 on:</b> November 15, 2004, 05:57:30 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Reason I asked is because I think your parents should definatly be made aware of how uncomfortable you feel having to punish your siblings when you are left in charge. If they do not listen or if take it as if you are just trying to weasle out of helping them. Your brother(s)/sister(s) are not your responsibility. If you volunteered to watch them, that is a whole different issue, but I still think you should tell your parents how you feel.<br /><br />Parents should NEVER .... I mean NEVER leave siblings in charge of other siblings! It leads to sibling anomosity. <br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
