	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg12688"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=745" title="View the profile of Needaa">Needaa</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Female.gif" alt="Female" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 41<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								<a href="http://edit.yahoo.com/config/send_webmesg?.target=miladymouse"><img src="http://opi.yahoo.com/online?u=miladymouse&amp;m=g&amp;t=0" alt="miladymouse" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="aim:goim?screenname=miladymouse&amp;message=Hi.+Are+you+there?"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/aim.gif" alt="miladymouse" border="0" /></a><br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=745"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1273.msg12688#msg12688"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1273.msg12688#msg12688">Re: Sibling Punishment. . .?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #11 on:</b> November 16, 2004, 08:17:45 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							My parents let me begin babysitting for a neighbor at age 14 with my mother only a few doors down (if I needed help).&nbsp; When she realized that I could handle it, she and my father agreed that on very special occasions, i.e. weddings (adult only), wedding anniversaries, etc.&nbsp; I could be trusted to watch my sisters, provided I follow the guidelines set down which my sisters were also aware of.&nbsp; I never betrayed their trust and my sisters always &quot;knew the score&quot;.&nbsp; &nbsp;Up until my dad&#039;s death, it was a written rule that I was in charge; however, mom&#039;s &quot;new&quot; improved system worked so well that this is the way I&#039;ve always handled babysitting with my own children.&nbsp; This way it&#039;s a democracy...each one feels important and no one feels as if they are considered the &quot;baby&quot;.&nbsp; <br /><br />Granted, times and situations change, but more so now than ever, it&#039;s extremely hard to find a good, trustworthy babysitter and what better way to show your children that they&#039;ve earned your trust and respect by allowing them to stay at home alone when the situation necessitates?
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
