							<span class="smalltext">
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Female.gif" alt="Female" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 81<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/ceres.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Kiss muh cute ass~<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=765"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1273.msg12690#msg12690"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1273.msg12690#msg12690">Re: Sibling Punishment. . .?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #12 on:</b> November 16, 2004, 11:06:10 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							So those parents who are on welfare popin out babies and spending their days and nights out and about while the oldest kids take care of the younger kids would be the same situation huh?&nbsp; And I am sure those kids have *earned their parents trust*<br /><br />Not saying my parents where like that, nor am I. I did however, have friends in High School and in Junior High that had parents like that. I have all too often seen parents who pawn their kids off on other people just because they need a break. My opinion on that is should have not had them in the first place!!! <br /><br />I am not saying this kids parents are not good parents and mean well. I do agree, as I stated earlier that he just needs to prolly sit down with his parents and talk to them about how he feels. I also think that maybe the reason he posted here is because he doesn&#039;t want to talk to his parents or his parents don&#039;t have time to talk to him. He also mentioned that his older siblings went with his mom to the church .. why take only a few of the children with you and leave the youngest ones at home?? To me that makes absolutely no sense at all. Not all parents have a good relationship with their parents too. <br /><br />I think maybe you should look outside your box Needaa. <br /><br />Oh, and pardon me for wanting to know the WHOLE story first, I like details.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
